FFmpeg patch for FM4 Recomp (LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes): the "xmaframes" decoder, one XMA frame per
packet. Ported from xenia-canary/FFmpeg_radixsplit 244cc2f281 ("avcodec/wmaprodec: add xma raw frame decoder", by
the Xenia developers) to FFmpeg 7.1.1 (FFCodec, AVFrame output, ch_layout); the decoding steps are unchanged.

